// Minimal HOF passing a field-access LAMBDA, applied to a record literal.
// apply's `a` mediates: f:(a)->b, x:a; the lambda's r must unify with {alpha,beta}
// through `a`. If my unify fix propagates, r.beta@4 resolves → 2.
fn apply(f, x) = f(x)
fn main(q) = apply((r) => r.beta, {alpha: 1, beta: 2})
